check 1
# Act I hireling equipment (q-chk-hirelings, REC-1519): ScnHrI carries a cap (inventory item, the first item
# unit, @4); hire from Kashya, take the cap to the cursor (C->S 0x19), give it to the hireling's head slot
# (C->S 0x61 bodyloc 1, inventory-moves.md §7.23, hirelings.md §11), then take it back (0x61 bodyloc 1 again).
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name hire-items-kashya
save ScnHrI --class bar --expansion --level 30 --gold 100000 --item cap
seed 1234
ticks 90
seconds 400
channels state
at 4 poke goto unit 1:150
at 8 send InteractWithEntity type=1 id=@1:150
at 10 send InitEntityChat id=@1:150
at 14 send HireMerc npc=@1:150 merc=3411
at 30 send RemoveItemFromBuffer item=@4
at 34 send MercItem bodyloc=1
at 50 send MercItem bodyloc=1
